/**
\page multigrid_home Multigrid

\li \subpage multigrid_architecture
\li \subpage multigrid_petsc

Peano's multigrid extension provides stand-alone multigrid solers. However, the
solver ingredients are designed in a way that they can be used by other codes, 
too.

## Configure PETSc

Our Peano 4 PETSc extensions are lain Peano 4 extensions which require a 
configuation that links against PETSc and includes the finite element toolbox:

~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
./configure ... --enable-finiteelements
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

The latter contains all the routines for our assemblies as well as the 
matrix-free solvers.

*/